        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana CHWT, Solid Brass Windsor Finial</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAn easy screw-on installation makes this cabinet hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishing details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Windsor cabinet finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last through years of continuous use.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAll Deltana decorative cabinet finials are available in matching finishes and fit interchangeably with any of the <a href=\"/collections/deltana-cabinet-hinges-and-cabinet-finials&owner=14914\"><b>Deltana Solid Brass Cabinet Hinges</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nCabinet hinge finials (tips) are packaged and sold individually. Order 2 per hinge, if you want finials on both the top and bottom of the cabinet hinge. For use with <b>Brass Cabinet Hinges</b>, not Brass Door Hinges.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"200\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/del-CHWT.jpg?v=1704354545\" width=\"200\" height=\"223\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Windsor Tip Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana Windsor Tip Cabinet Finial:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Diameter: 5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Easy screw-on installation</li>\r\n<li>Sold Individually</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-CHWT-specifications.pdf?v=1691095334\" target=\"new\"><b>Windsor Tip Cabinet Hinge Finial Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe PVD Polished Brass Finish (CR003) is recommended for harsh environments such as high salt or intense temperatures; it has the appearance of polished brass but without the ordinary problems such as easy tarnishing, discoloration, flaking, or pitting commonly associated with a standard polished brass finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Windsor Tip Cabinet Solid Brass Finial, Deltana CHWT",
                "description": "Deltana CHWT Windsor Cabinet Finial - An easy screw-on installation makes this cabinet hinge finial an effortless way to add the finishing details that help turn a house into a beautiful home. The Windsor cabinet finial is made by Deltana out of durable solid brass so you know it will last through years of continuous use. Available in 8 finishes.",
